# Patterns

Purpose:
  Reusable resilience and reliability patterns for the SDDRA system.
  These patterns are applied across all stages and components.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1  @INDEX.sdd
   2  @circuit-breaker.sdd
   3  @checkpoint-restore.sdd
   4  @graceful-degradation.sdd

Rules:
  [P1] Patterns are READ-ONLY — they MUST NOT be modified.
  [P2] Patterns are applied automatically by the orchestrator.
  [P3] Pattern violations are logged and reported.
  [P4] Patterns can be disabled per-chain if needed.

Navigation:
  CircuitBreaker: @circuit-breaker.sdd
  CheckpointRestore: @checkpoint-restore.sdd
  GracefulDegradation: @graceful-degradation.sdd
  Resilience: @RESILIENCE.md

State: +
